# Mavuika Q C E > Xilonen E N2 > Mona Q > Mualani E 3[3-stacked bite] > Xilonen Q > Mona N1D >
# Mavuika Q C E > Xilonen E N2 > Mona Q > Mualani E 3[3-stacked bite] > Mona D N2C
